{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisites: Dexterity 15 or higher, Proficient with daggers. Your mastery over daggers and other similar light blades allow them to become truly deadly instruments in your hands.\n\n- You gain a +1 bonus to attack rolls you make with a dagger or similar weapon\n\n- You gain a +1 bonus to AC while you are wielding a separate dagger in each hand.\n\n- The damage bonus of your Dexterity modifier used to calculate the damage of an an attack with a dagger is doubled. Additionally you add your Dexterity modifier to the damage rolls of off-hand attacks made with a dagger, even if you don\u0027t have the Dual-Fighting style.","level":1}],"id":"Customcfc675b0-8e48-4e9b-a0d0-2e9af01f648a","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dagger Mastery [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}